  "title": "Walmart opens its store to outside AI shopping agents",
  "caption": "Can an AI shop Walmart for you? 🛒🤖\n\nWalmart says outside AI agents will soon be able to shop Walmart.com and Sam's Club for you, through a new Agent Gateway that starts as a beta for developers. Each agent gets its own profile in your account: you approve every order, or set a spending cap (Walmart's examples: $50, $100, $200). Per Walmart, agents never get your card details and can't change how you pay. Rollout is expected within about a month. ⏳\n\nWould you let an agent shop for you? Tell me below, and send this to the friend who'd try it first. 👇",
